Subject: [PATCH] Mac front end: DM_KEYMAP and DM_PAD_MAP

input_map.h parses the maps; front_mac.m applies them to keys and controller buttons.

Upstream-Status: forwarded seedds/nxnative#386
Reason: The launcher's Controls page: DM_KEYMAP and DM_PAD_MAP move buttons to other keys and controller buttons (open upstream, #386)
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#386
